{"title": "What Happened in College Football Saturday: Gators Take Down No. 4 Ole Miss as Top 25 Shakes", "excerpt": "Florida beat No. 4 Ole Miss 52-28 to move to 4-0, while Wisconsin and Wake Forest pulled road upsets and No. 1 Texas and No. 2 Georgia stayed unbeaten ahead of Sunday's AP poll.", "seoSlug": "college-football-saturday-week-4-wrap-gators-ole-miss-top-25", "memberId": "16433bab-ee11-4e09-9f6c-cac7a12ec042", "categoryIds": ["a4577921-a2e9-41bb-8a5d-4a9c56f2eb5b"], "media": {"wixMedia": {"image": {"id": "d3cfa5_5ddb1400abed437c85eb72fecd6b7e1f~mv2.png", "altText": "GatorBait Media Saturday Scoreboard: No. 21 Florida 52, No. 4 Ole Miss 28, and Week 4 Top 25 finals."}}, "displayed": true, "custom": true}, "richContent": {"nodes": [{"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n1", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "By GatorBait Media Staff", "decorations": [{"type": "ITALIC", "italicData": true}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n2", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "GAINESVILLE — The biggest result in the SEC on Saturday happened in The Swamp. Here is everything else that happened in Week 4, and what it means for Florida.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "HEADING", "id": "n3", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "The Gators", "decorations": []}}], "headingData": {"level": 2}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n4", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 21 Florida beat No. 4 Ole Miss 52-28 at Ben Hill Griffin Stadium. Jadan Baugh ran for 142 yards and three touchdowns, Duke Clark added 126 rushing yards, and the Gators scored touchdowns on their first five possessions of the second half. Florida ran for 302 yards, did not turn the ball over and moved to 4-0, 2-0 in the SEC. Ole Miss fell to 3-1.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n5", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "It was the only loss by a top-five team this week. ", "decorations": []}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Full game story: Baugh Game: Gators run over No. 4 Ole Miss 52-28 in The Swamp", "decorations": [{"type": "LINK", "linkData": {"link": {"url": "https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/florida-ole-miss-final-baugh-gators-run-over-rebels", "target": "BLANK", "rel": {"noreferrer": true}}}}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": ".", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "HEADING", "id": "n6", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Top 25 roundup", "decorations": []}}], "headingData": {"level": 2}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n7", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Rankings are from last week's AP poll. All scores are final and confirmed by ESPN.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n8", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 1 Texas 20, No. 14 Tennessee 17", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n9", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 2 Georgia 41, Oklahoma 13", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n10", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 3 Notre Dame 49, Purdue 10", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n11", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 21 Florida 52, No. 4 Ole Miss 28", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n12", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 5 Indiana 29, Northwestern 23", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": " (Friday)", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n13", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 6 Miami 52, Central Michigan 3", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n14", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 7 Ohio State 42, Illinois 19", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n15", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 8 Alabama 49, South Carolina 18", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n16", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 9 BYU (idle)", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n17", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 10 LSU 35, No. 23 Texas A&M 6", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n18", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 11 Texas Tech 49, Sam Houston 14", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n19", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 20 Oregon 41, No. 12 USC 27", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n20", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Wisconsin 24, No. 13 Penn State 20", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n21", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 15 Utah 31, Iowa State 17", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n22", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Wake Forest 30, No. 16 Louisville 27", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n23", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 17 Iowa 20, No. 18 Michigan 19", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n24", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 24 Mississippi State 31, No. 19 Missouri 24", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n25", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 22 SMU 34, Missouri State 24", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n26", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 25 Houston 42, Georgia Southern 28", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n27", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "The upsets. ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Wisconsin rallied from a 17-0 deficit to beat No. 13 Penn State 24-20 at Beaver Stadium, handing the Nittany Lions their first loss. Wake Forest won 30-27 at No. 16 Louisville after blocking a 57-yard field goal attempt in the final seconds. Florida's win over Ole Miss was the only loss by a top-five team.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n28", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "The escapes. ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 1 Texas held on at No. 14 Tennessee 20-17 behind Colin Simmons, who tied a program record with five sacks. No. 5 Indiana survived Northwestern 29-23 on Friday night. No. 17 Iowa beat No. 18 Michigan 20-19 on Hank Brown's 16-yard touchdown pass to Reece Vander Zee on the final play.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n29", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "The late games. ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 20 Oregon won 41-27 at No. 12 USC after quarterback Dante Moore was carted off in the second quarter; Dylan Raiola came on and threw for 289 yards and two touchdowns. No. 22 SMU rallied from a 10-0 deficit to beat Missouri State 34-24 as Kevin Jennings threw for 464 yards and became the program's career passing leader.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "HEADING", "id": "n30", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "SEC", "decorations": []}}], "headingData": {"level": 2}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n31", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 1 Texas 20, No. 14 Tennessee 17", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n32", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 2 Georgia 41, Oklahoma 13", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n33", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 21 Florida 52, No. 4 Ole Miss 28", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n34", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Auburn 21, Vanderbilt 15", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n35", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Kentucky 45, South Alabama 21", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n36", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 8 Alabama 49, South Carolina 18", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n37", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 10 LSU 35, No. 23 Texas A&M 6", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n38", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "No. 24 Mississippi State 31, No. 19 Missouri 24", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n39", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Arkansas 34, Tulsa 6", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n40", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Georgia forced four turnovers and led 28-0 at halftime. Chris Cole returned a fumble 85 yards for a touchdown, and Oklahoma quarterback John Mateer turned it over three times in the first half. Auburn handed Vanderbilt its first loss behind two touchdowns from Byrum Brown and a blocked-punt return for a score.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n41", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Keelon Russell threw for 365 yards and four touchdowns as Alabama stayed unbeaten. Sam Leavitt hit Jackson Harris for two touchdowns, one for 57 yards on a fourth-down call, in LSU's win over Texas A&M. Arkansas snapped a 12-game losing streak against FBS opponents.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "HEADING", "id": "n42", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "What it means for Florida", "decorations": []}}], "headingData": {"level": 2}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n43", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Missouri is next.", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": " Florida plays at Missouri on Saturday, Oct. 3, at 3:30 p.m. ET. The Tigers lost for the first time Saturday night, 31-24 at No. 24 Mississippi State. Missouri led 24-17 after three quarters, but Kamario Taylor threw for 360 yards and three touchdowns, including the go-ahead 24-yard pass to Sanfrisco Magee with 3:57 left. Missouri is 3-1; Mississippi State is 4-0.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n44", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Here is how the rest of Florida's schedule fared Saturday:", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n45", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Oct. 10, South Carolina: ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "lost at No. 8 Alabama 49-18 and fell to 2-2.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n46", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Oct. 17, at Texas: ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "beat No. 14 Tennessee 20-17 to move to 4-0.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n47", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Oct. 31, Georgia in Jacksonville: ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "beat Oklahoma 41-13 to move to 4-0.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n48", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Nov. 7, Oklahoma: ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "lost at Georgia and fell to 2-2.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n49", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Nov. 14, at Kentucky: ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "beat South Alabama 45-21 and is 3-1.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n50", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Nov. 21, Vanderbilt: ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "lost at Auburn 21-15 and is 3-1.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n51", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "Nov. 27, at Florida State: ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "beat Central Arkansas 34-7 and is 2-2.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n52", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "The road ahead includes both of the top two teams in last week's poll. Texas and Georgia are each 4-0, and Florida has to see both in October. Those two games and Saturday's result are the Gators' clearest path to a playoff résumé: Florida now owns a win over a top-five team, and Auburn's win over previously unbeaten Vanderbilt adds weight to the Gators' 44-39 win at Jordan-Hare a week ago.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}, {"type": "PARAGRAPH", "id": "n53", "nodes": [{"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "The poll. ", "decorations": [{"type": "BOLD", "fontWeightValue": 700}]}}, {"type": "TEXT", "id": "", "nodes": [], "textData": {"text": "The new AP Top 25 comes out at 2 p.m. ET Sunday. Eight ranked teams lost: Ole Miss, Tennessee, Penn State, USC, Louisville, Michigan, Missouri and Texas A&M. Florida handed a top-five team its only loss of the week, by 24 points.", "decorations": []}}], "paragraphData": {}}]}}